# The SHA-256 of the certificate of each Vyre Android signing key (lower-case hex, no colons), one line per key: "<name> <sha256>".
# A release reads this file from the PREVIOUS published release tag, not from the commit being released, so one commit cannot change the key and its pin.
# PENDING until the first signing: run the native-android workflow with record_cert, check the fingerprint it prints is your key, and commit it here.
sideload PENDING
